     1582        SIZE 3 BY 1.
     1583   DEFINE BUTTON B-mark
     1584        LABEL "&*"
     1585        SIZE 3 BY 1.
     1586   DEFINE BUTTON B-print
     1587        LABEL "Пе&чать"
     1588        SIZE 3 BY 1.
